# ITSM scheduled email — data rules

Read `docs/release-notes/2026-08-21-report-kpi-fixes.md` and `AGENTS.md` first.
Deploy target for email numbers: `refex-schedule-runner` only.

## KPI cards (Admin All — no Me/Team/Closed By)

| Card | Condition |
|------|-----------|
| Total Tickets | Entity-scoped process items (Refex includes blank Entity) |
| Open | NOT Closed, NOT Rejected, NOT Cancelled |
| Closed | NOT Rejected AND (IT Tech Reopen / ReOpen Window / Employee Feedback **or** Kissflow **Completed**). Not Statu_1 Closed alone |
| Opened Today | Created today IST **and** still Open |
| Closed Today | Closed rule + closed-at today IST (`_modified_at` first on reopen) |
| Signed In Today / Total Users | MIS user table (app role members); green row if signed in today |

Live overlay: `count-live-today-kpis.js` preferred over SQL when available.

## Ticket source panel (Email / WhatsApp / Mobile / Web)

Root cause of Email/Mobile always 0: Source often lives on report Column ids, not `Source`.

Extract from (in order):

- `Source` / `Ticket_Source` / `Channel` / `Raised_By` / `Entity_Source` (string or `{Name,Value,v}`)
- Refex: `Column_BDSZ_sAHys`
- Extrovis: `Column_hFjGV8lRrn`

Classify: whats→WhatsApp; email/mail→Email; mobile/phone/sms/app→Mobile; web/portal/browser/desktop→Web; else Other.

Shared helper: `services/engagement-pipeline/scripts/itsm-ticket-source.js`  
SQL + live overlay in `06-render-html-report.sh`.

Show **0 only when the channel truly has zero tickets**. If data exists, counts must be non-zero. Prefer live source overlay when SQL mapped Email+WhatsApp+Mobile+Web is 0.

